+# Implementation Plan: Fix frai-core Test Suite
+
+**Branch**: `001-fix-frai-core-tests` | **Date**: 2026-09-21 | **Spec**: [spec.md](./spec.md)
+
+**Input**: Feature specification from `specs/001-fix-frai-core-tests/spec.md`
+
+## Summary
+
+Fix two test failures in frai-core by correcting the source code:
+1. **Toxicity metric scoring bug**: The `toxicityMetric` function receives references array as bannedTerms parameter, causing it to flag all outputs as toxic, resulting in score 0 instead of 1.
+2. **Missing APPROVAL_STATUSES export**: The governance module doesn't export `APPROVAL_STATUSES` as a named export, causing test import to fail with undefined reference.
+
+Both fixes require minimal changes to existing code with no breaking changes to public APIs.
+
+## Technical Context
+
+**Language/Version**: Node.js (ES modules), JavaScript
+
+**Primary Dependencies**: Vitest (testing), eslint (linting)
+
+**Storage**: N/A (evaluation and governance are pure functions)
+
+**Testing**: Vitest test runner
+
+**Target Platform**: Node.js runtime
+
+**Project Type**: Library (frai-core is a shared library package in monorepo)
+
+**Performance Goals**: N/A (performance not impacted by bug fixes)
+
+**Constraints**: Must not break existing public API exports; must maintain backward compatibility
+
+**Scale/Scope**: Package contains ~600 LOC across eval and governance modules; 28 total tests
+
+## Constitution Check
+
+*GATE: Must pass before Phase 0 research. Re-check after Phase 1 design.*
+
+✅ **No violations** - This is a bug fix within existing modules:
+- No new modules or architectural patterns introduced
+- Public API exports preserved (backward compatible)
+- Tests define expected behavior (test-first validation confirmed)
+- Existing library structure maintained
+
+## Project Structure
+
+### Documentation (this feature)
+
+```text
+specs/001-fix-frai-core-tests/
+├── plan.md              # This file
+├── quickstart.md        # Validation scenarios
+└── checklists/
+    └── requirements.md  # Quality checklist
+```
+
+### Source Code (monorepo structure)
+
+```text
+packages/frai-core/
+├── src/
+│   ├── eval/
+│   │   ├── index.js         # [FIX-1] toxicityMetric integration
+│   │   ├── index.test.js    # (do not modify)
+│   │   ├── metrics.js       # (no changes needed)
+│   │   └── reporters.js
+│   ├── finetune/
+│   │   ├── index.js         # [FIX-2] export APPROVAL_STATUSES
+│   │   ├── index.test.js    # (do not modify)
+│   │   └── schema.js        # (source of APPROVAL_STATUSES)
+│   └── [other modules...]
+├── package.json
+└── vitest.config.js
+
+# Test execution
+pnpm --filter frai-core test          # All tests
+pnpm --filter frai-core test -- src/eval/index.test.js        # Issue 1
+pnpm --filter frai-core test -- src/finetune/governance.test.js # Issue 2
+```
+
+**Structure Decision**: Monorepo with single package (frai-core). Changes are isolated to eval and governance modules with no cross-module impact.
